<section class="fragment-instrument" data-artifact="instrument" data-slice="tactics-and-ai">
  <!-- @include-skip the signal table is hand-inlined as in the prior revisions of this artifact -->
  <table class="in-signals">
    <thead><tr><th>Signal</th><th>Kind</th><th>Where</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>match-event (change verdicts at a stoppage)</td><td>event</td><td>crates/engine-cli/src/stream_run.rs</td></tr>
      <tr><td>match-event (substitution, injury, ai-decision)</td><td>event</td><td>crates/engine-cli/src/stream_run.rs</td></tr>
      <tr><td>change.applied</td><td>event</td><td>crates/engine/src/tactics/change.rs</td></tr>
      <tr><td>change.rejected</td><td>log</td><td>crates/engine/src/tactics/change.rs</td></tr>
      <tr><td>ai.decision</td><td>event</td><td>crates/engine/src/ai.rs</td></tr>
      <tr><td>injury.occurred</td><td>event</td><td>crates/engine/src/rules/mod.rs</td></tr>
      <tr><td>match-stats tactics fields</td><td>gauge</td><td>crates/engine/src/observe/mod.rs</td></tr>
      <tr><td>tactics.plan</td><td>log</td><td>crates/engine/src/tactics/mod.rs</td></tr>
      <tr><td>run-report per-match processor time</td><td>gauge</td><td>crates/engine-cli/src/bench.rs</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <div class="in-dark">
    <aside class="callout callout-warn"><div class="callout-hd">Change never applied</div><div class="callout-body">The shape's dark path closes here: every change ends as an applied or rejected event, and darkpath.change_never_applied counts what is still pending at full time.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-info"><div class="callout-hd">Silent AI</div><div class="callout-body">Every AI choice emits an ai-decision event, and ai.decisions counts them.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-info"><div class="callout-hd">Invisible fatigue</div><div class="callout-body">fatigue.mean_pct at full time and the energy in injury.occurred.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-info"><div class="callout-hd">Rejection without a reason</div><div class="callout-body">Every rejection carries change.rejected_reason.</div></aside>
  </div>
  <style>
    .fragment-instrument .in-signals { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .fragment-instrument .in-signals th, .fragment-instrument .in-signals td { text-align: left; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(127,127,127,0.25); }
    .fragment-instrument .in-dark { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; }
  </style>
  <script>
    (function () {
      var root = document.currentScript.closest('.fragment-instrument');
      var signals = root ? root.querySelectorAll('.in-signals tbody tr').length : 0;
      var dark = root ? root.querySelectorAll('.in-dark .callout').length : 0;
      window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('sdlc:fragment-ready', { detail: { name: 'instrument', artifact: 'instrument', counts: { signals: signals, darkPaths: dark, pii: 0 } } }));
    })();
  </script>
</section>
